type: software
title: NIfTI Prep
abstract: Step 1 of the Clinical Brain MRI Volumetrics workflow. Reorients structural MRI volumes to RAS
  with nibabel, converting DICOM series with dcm2niix first, sorts them by modality into BIDS-style names
  and writes image metadata.
